eabed that has long since dried out, and you follow them in a strange sail-driven land vessel. The vehicle is the center of the game: you keep it running, repair and upgrade it, and use it to get past obstacles and harsh weather. Relics and abandoned buildings along the route hint at what happened to the people who came before.\n\nFAR: Lone Sails is quiet and atmospheric, with drifting clouds, wind in the sails and a post-apocalypse that has no zombies, only you and your machine. It is single-player with full controller support, and it suits players who like contemplative journeys with a hands-on, mechanical side."}}